                                        "entry_id": "e175d5f2-1463-316f-8064-027388a3ae74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A discrete organ in the center of a flower capable of receiving pollen and producing a fruit, it is divided into an ovary, style and stigma."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f91fd3a-db59-434c-b6c3-1cfb62b91690",
                                                "sense_id": "5e3a0fe3-0ab5-359b-ad63-dd0af56eb59f",
                                                "text": "Some plant species have more than one pistil per flower."
                                            }
